---
const ko = Astro.props.lang === 'ko';
const prefixLength = 3;
const tokens = ['P1', 'P2', 'P3', 'T1', 'T2', 'T3', 'T4'];
const mask = tokens.map((_, row) => tokens.map((_, column) => column < prefixLength || column <= row));
---

<figure class="prefix-mask">
  <table>
    <caption>{ko ? '행은 질의 위치, 열은 참조할 키 위치' : 'Rows are query positions. Columns are key positions.'}</caption>
    <thead>
      <tr>
        <th scope="col">{ko ? '질의' : 'Query'}</th>
        {tokens.map(token => <th scope="col">{token}</th>)}
      </tr>
    </thead>
    <tbody>
      {tokens.map((query, row) => (
        <tr>
          <th scope="row">{query}</th>
          {mask[row].map(visible => <td class={visible ? 'visible' : undefined}>{visible ? '1' : '0'}</td>)}
        </tr>
      ))}
    </tbody>
  </table>
  <p>{ko ? '1 = 참조 가능 · 0 = 차단. 굵은 선은 접두사(P)와 생성 구간(T)의 경계입니다.' : '1 = visible · 0 = blocked. The heavier rules separate prefix (P) from target (T).'}</p>
  <figcaption>
    {ko ? 'Raffel 등의 그림 3에 나오는 규칙을 일곱 위치에 적용해 HTML 표로 계산했습니다.' : 'HTML table calculated for seven positions using the mask rule in Figure 3 of Raffel et al.'}
    {' '}<a href="#ref-2">[2]</a>
  </figcaption>
</figure>

<style>
  .prefix-mask {
    margin: 1.5rem 0;
    max-width: 34rem;
  }
  .prefix-mask table {
    display: table;
    width: 100%;
    margin: 0;
    table-layout: fixed;
    border-collapse: collapse;
    border-radius: 0;
    box-shadow: none;
    font-variant-numeric: tabular-nums;
  }
  .prefix-mask caption {
    padding-bottom: .6rem;
    color: #263749;
    text-align: left;
    font-weight: 600;
  }
  .prefix-mask :is(th, td) {
    padding: .35rem .1rem;
    text-align: center;
    border: 1px solid #ccd6dd;
  }
  .prefix-mask tr > :first-child { width: 3.5rem; }
  .prefix-mask th { background: #f1f5f7; }
  .prefix-mask td { background: #fff; color: #596778; }
  .prefix-mask td.visible { background: #cbe8df; color: #174a40; font-weight: 600; }
  .prefix-mask tr > :nth-child(5) { border-left: 2px solid #3e5968; }
  .prefix-mask tbody tr:nth-child(4) > * { border-top: 2px solid #3e5968; }
  .prefix-mask p { margin: .55rem 0 .25rem; }
  .prefix-mask figcaption { color: #465565; font-size: .9rem; }
</style>
